{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43303","headline":"观北番谒庙 · 王卓","name":"观北番谒庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肃肃层城里，巍巍祖庙清。\n圣恩覃布濩，异域献精诚。\n冠盖分行列，戎夷变姓名。\n礼终齐百拜，心洁尽忠贞。\n瑞气千重色，箫韶九奏声。\n仗移迎日转，斾动逐风轻。\n休运威仪盛，丰年俎豆盈。\n不堪惭颂德，空此望簪缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王卓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}